        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/03d025b7b2a8f7ddf63327bd863accdf.avif?t=1780625040\" width=454 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/3db2ac5a7531cbf3a5412ca233c7e7b5.avif?t=1780625040\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras_big/3db2ac5a7531cbf3a5412ca233c7e7b5.avif?t=1780625040 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heili, a musician who's six years into his career but still has pretty mediocre fame, ends up winning the life-or-death variety show &quot;VIAGRA&quot; along with his bandmates! One of the members died and another had a head injury, but that's non of his business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A year later, Heili gets an another offer to be on that show. Oh, It seems like staffs want him back on the exact same show as last year! They said all the previous VIAGRA winners are gathering this time. And the prize money is ten times what it was last year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 21 participants. To win, you have to find and kill all the &quot;Varient&quot; participants who are threatening other's life for money and fame. Will he be able to win here again and take the prize?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/7f32b60ae90151b04f28093a5af96322.avif?t=1780625040\" width=454 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;PERIOD SURVIVAL:Final Trial&quot; is &quot;PERIOD SURVIVAL&quot;'s sequal, an adventure game the story goes through deduction and battles. It features keyboard rhythm game-like something and simple minigame, and you can progress through the story by clearing them one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/bc81cb5b15ae2425891bd980961e3b3f.avif?t=1780625040\" width=454 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/69e39cbac98fc35c82d3f45fd5751463.poster.avif?t=1780625040\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/69e39cbac98fc35c82d3f45fd5751463.webm?t=1780625040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/69e39cbac98fc35c82d3f45fd5751463.mp4?t=1780625040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a memory-based game looks like a rhythm game. you have to memorize and press keyboard arrow keys until the turn ends. Go for a PERFECT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/289d1c1fd2a18eb09436eb6f1cbd52db.avif?t=1780625040\" width=454 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/56176722575bb463fb4187987f203052.avif?t=1780625040\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras_big/56176722575bb463fb4187987f203052.avif?t=1780625040 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the &quot;Varient&quot; participant who is out to kill the others for the money, you'll need to investigate and deduction. With the confidence of a last-season legendary, search every corner of the studio thoroughly to fine the &quot;Varient!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/b58753dcf22b81e312431e1594fd7b36.avif?t=1780625040\" width=454 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras/7d90c2de0140d4d1dd33ba961b5c8888.avif?t=1780625040\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689200/extras_big/7d90c2de0140d4d1dd33ba961b5c8888.avif?t=1780625040 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the clues you've found and the results of the dance battle, you can debate with the other participants to figure out who the &quot;Variant&quot; is. Occasionally, there are weirdos who try to use guesswork, but you can just shut those bastards down with your silver tongue. Be careful, though—if you screw up during the debate, you'll end up falling into a pit of fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The full version is only available in Korean now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plugins:  Yoji Ojima, VisuStella, Mokusei Penguin, ZainWD, Maxii1996  </p>",
